Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.35,0:01:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会惹祸吧 比尔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure I won't get in trouble, Bill?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.91,0:01:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,别这么胆 胆 胆小嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be a wuss.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.87,0:01:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我没病入膏肓肯定跟你一起 起 起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd come with you if I weren't dying.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.19,0:01:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你没病得那么重\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not dying!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.63,0:01:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你没见我今早飞流鼻 鼻涕三千尺吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't see the vomit coming out of my nose this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.99,0:01:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,真够恶心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.91,0:01:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,行啦 给我拿点石蜡过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Go get the wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.47,0:01:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,得去地窖拿吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cellar?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.23,0:01:46.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不是你说要玩纸船漂 漂流的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want it to float, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.39,0:01:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.39,0:02:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.11,0:02:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,快点哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点都不怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I'm brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.95,0:03:23.50,Default,,0,0,0,,蜡放在哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's the wax?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.07,0:03:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the wax.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.31,0:03:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,就在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.39,0:03:50.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么? 那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that? What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.47,0:03:52.47,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.51,0:04:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.39,0:04:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,做好啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}There you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.35,0:04:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,她可 可 可以出航了 船长\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's all ready, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.43,0:04:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,她?\N{\fnArial\fs30}She?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.63,0:04:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,船都得用"她"来称呼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You always call boats "she".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.59,0:04:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,她就她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}"She".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.09,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Billy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.43,0:04:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,待会儿见 拜拜\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,注意安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.91,0:05:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.15,0:05:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.15,0:05:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔知道了会气炸了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Bill's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.59,0:06:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你好呀 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.07,0:06:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这船真漂亮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a nice boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.59,0:06:17.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你想拿回去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want it back?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.51,0:06:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 麻烦你还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, yes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.43,0:06:23.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你像是个乖孩子 我猜你肯定有不少朋友吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like a nice boy. I bet you have a lot of friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.03,0:06:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我有三个好朋友 不过我跟我哥哥是最最要好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, but my brother's my best best.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.87,0:06:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,他在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.47,0:06:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他病了 一直卧床休息呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}In bed. Sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.87,0:06:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我想我能让他好起来 我会给他个气球做礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet I can cheer him up. I'll give him a balloon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.91,0:06:39.42,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治 你也想要个气球吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want a balloon too, Georgie?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.79,0:06:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,妈妈告诉我不能收陌生人给的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not supposed to take stuff from strangers.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.19,0:06:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我叫潘尼怀斯 是个会跳舞的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh... Well, I'm Pennywise the Dancing Clown.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,潘尼怀斯在这见过乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pennywise? Yes. Meet Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.15,0:06:56.38,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治也算是见过潘尼怀斯啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie, meet Pennywise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.51,0:07:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我们就不算是陌生了 是吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we aren't strangers, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.35,0:07:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么跑到下水道里了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing in the sewer?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.35,0:07:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,是风暴把我丢进了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}A storm blew me away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.55,0:07:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,整个马戏团都遭到了风暴袭击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blew the whole circus away.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你能闻到马戏团独有的味道吗 乔治?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you smell the circus, Georgie?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.95,0:07:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有花生 棉花糖\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's peanuts, cotton candy,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.39,0:07:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,热狗\N{\fnArial\fs30}hot dogs,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.15,0:07:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还有\N{\fnArial\fs30}and...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.79,0:07:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,爆米花?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,对 爆米花 是你的最爱吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Popcorn! Is that your favorite?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.43,0:07:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- 对呀 - 也是我的最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh-huh. - Mine, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.23,0:07:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,因为爆米花会爆裂开 噗噗噗的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they pop. Pop, pop, pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.63,0:07:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,噗 噗 噗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop, pop, pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:07:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,噗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.27,0:08:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我该回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should get going now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.39,0:08:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.91,0:08:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,不要你的船了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without your boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会不要它的 是吧乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't wanna lose it, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.99,0:08:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔可是会被你气炸的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill's gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.39,0:08:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.91,0:08:27.22,Default,,0,0,0,,拿回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.99,0:08:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,拿回去啊 乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it, Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.47,0:08:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.83,0:09:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Billy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.93,0:09:42.73,Title,,0,0,0,,《小丑回魂》
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.35,0:10:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,扣扳机啊 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pull it, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.87,0:10:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,动手啊 扣扳机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on now, pull it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.63,0:10:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,给 去装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, reload it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.87,0:10:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克 你必须开始承担更多的责任了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to start taking more responsibility around here, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你父亲比你现在这个年纪还小的时候就…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your dad was younger than you when he took...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.67,0:10:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是我爸爸 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not my dad, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.59,0:10:36.62,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.55,0:10:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,小子 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.07,0:10:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,我说看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.67,0:10:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这世界你只能做两种人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are two places you can be in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.47,0:10:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,一种是跟我们一样做个拿枪的人 另一种就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can be out here like us or you can be in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.83,0:10:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,挨枪子的畜生\N{\fnArial\fs30}like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你再磨磨蹭蹭地犹豫不决\N{\fnArial\fs30}You waste time hemming and hawing,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.51,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,迟早有一天你的命运将由他人掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}and someone else is gonna make that choice for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,而你在死之前都不会知道是被谁玩弄于鼓掌之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except you won't know it until you feel that bolt between your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.19,0:11:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,有个犹太人教堂 你知道吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, there's this church full of Jews, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.43,0:11:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦利必须在那完成他的超级犹太式成人礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Stan has to take this super Jewy test.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么完成?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how's it work?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.47,0:11:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会把他小丁丁的尖儿切掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}They slice the tip of his dick off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.15,0:11:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但要是这样的话 斯坦利就成太监了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then Stan will have nothing left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.67,0:11:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你说的对 - 等等我 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's true. - Wait up, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.55,0:11:26.01,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 斯坦利 你的成人礼到底是个什么流程?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Stan, what happens at the Bar Mitzvah, anyways?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.27,0:11:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪说他们会给你小丁丁的尖儿切 切 切掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ed says they slice the tip of your dick off.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:32.03,Default,,0,0,0,,对啊 我觉着是这样 犹太教祭祀会脱掉你的裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I think the rabbi's gonna pull down your pants,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.23,0:11:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,然后面向所有人说 "你的小丁丁呢?"\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn to the crowd and say, "Where's the beef?"
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.07,0:11:37.45,Default,,0,0,0,,在成人礼上 我会朗读《摩西五经》\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the Bar Mitzvah, I read from the Torah,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.67,0:11:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,然后还要发表讲话 经历这些后我就变成男人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I make a speech and suddenly, I become a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.23,0:11:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我能想到更嗨皮的方式过我的成人礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could think of funner ways to become a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.99,0:11:43.15,Default,,0,0,0,,"更嗨皮"指的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"More fun" you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.31,0:11:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,倒霉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.51,0:11:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉着他们会在我的纪念册上签名留言吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think they'll sign my yearbook?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.79,0:11:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,"亲爱的里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dear Richie,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,上个月在你书包里拉了一坨还冒热乎气的翔 抱歉啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}sorry for taking a hot, steaming dump in your backpack last March.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.15,0:11:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你暑假愉快"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a good summer. "
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.95,0:12:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,你是独自藏在厕所间里吗 "海狸"利?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you in there by yourself, Beaver-ly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.75,0:12:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说你正跟全校半数男生鬼混呢啊 浪货?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or do you have half the guys in the school with you, huh, slut?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.27,0:12:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你在里面 你个小贱人 我能闻到你身上骚味\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you're in there, little shit. I can smell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.03,0:12:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你这骚样能有朋友就怪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No wonder you don't have any friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.03,0:12:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,到底是哪个词 格里塔 浪货还是小贱人?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is it, Gretta? Am I a slut or a little shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.43,0:12:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,想好再喷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make up your mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你就是个垃圾\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're trash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.51,0:12:29.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只不过是想给你提个醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanted to remind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.75,0:12:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,真是个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such a loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,至少你现在骚味不那么重了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, at least now you'll smell better.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.79,0:12:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.39,0:12:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,咱们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.15,0:12:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,祝你暑假愉快 "海狸"利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice summer, Beaver-ly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.99,0:12:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,真可悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.15,0:12:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉爽爆了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Best feeling ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.47,0:12:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,这就爽了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.63,0:12:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你试试吧 撸管比这爽得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try tickling your pickle for the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.71,0:12:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你们明天有什么计划吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, what do you guys wanna do tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.91,0:12:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我要开始训练了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I start my training.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.23,0:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- 训练什么? - 街头霸王啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, what training? - Street Fighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你准备把一整个暑假都用在玩街机上?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you wanna spend your summer? Inside of an arcade?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.07,0:13:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,总比你整天窝在你妈妈身边要强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beats spending it inside of your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.87,0:13:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 哦 - 那我们去矿场怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh! - What if we go to the quarry?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟们 我们还得去荒 荒地呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, we have the Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.27,0:13:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.59,0:13:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,贝蒂·瑞普森的妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty Ripsom's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.43,0:13:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,她还指望能在学校接到孩子吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is she really expecting to see her come out of that school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,似乎贝蒂这几周一直在躲着大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}As if Betty Ripsom's been hiding in Home Ec. for the last few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉着警察会找到她吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think they'll actually find her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.71,0:13:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,肯定能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.91,0:13:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,他们会在阴沟里找到已腐烂的贝蒂 浑身爬满蛆虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a ditch. All decomposed, covered in worms and maggots.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.55,0:13:30.72,Default,,0,0,0,,闻着就像埃迪他妈妈的内裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Smelling like Eddie's mom's underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.75,0:13:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧你 真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! That's freaking disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.35,0:13:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,她没死 她只是失 失 失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not dead. She's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.11,0:13:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉比尔 她只是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Bill. She's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,其实荒地那也不是很糟糕啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the Barrens aren't that bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.11,0:13:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,没谁会不喜欢在臭水沟里嬉戏吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who doesn't love splashing around in shitty water?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.71,0:13:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这飞盘挺好啊 你个死玻璃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice Frisbee, flamer.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.27,0:13:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.19,0:13:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一帮废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fucking losers!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.47,0:13:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loser.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.87,0:14:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你才是废 废 废物 鲍尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You suck, Bowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.87,0:14:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,快别这么说 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.11,0:14:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚才说 说 说什么 比 比 比尔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You say something, Billy?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们给你免虐卡是因为你弟弟死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a free ride this year 'cause of your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.59,0:14:18.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在卡到期了 登布洛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ride's over, Denbrough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.95,0:14:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,这个暑假老子要玩死你们这帮废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This summer's gonna be a hurt train for you and your faggot friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.83,0:14:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我希望失踪的那个是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish he'd go missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.67,0:14:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,可能就是他把贝蒂绑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's probably the one doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.83,0:14:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你是打算让我过去呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna let me go by?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.03,0:14:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还是说得有什么口令才行?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is there a secret password or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.11,0:15:01.11,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.67,0:15:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 - 抱歉可算不上是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um, sorry. - Sorry isn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.39,0:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,口令\N{\fnArial\fs30}A password.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.59,0:15:18.38,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利那伙人渣在学校西门那边呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Henry and his goons are over by the west entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你应该不会有麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you should be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.99,0:15:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wasn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.19,0:15:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都知道他们在堵你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone knows he's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.03,0:15:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你听谁的歌呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you listening to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.99,0:15:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,新街边男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Kids on the Block.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.39,0:15:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我压根就不喜欢这乐队 我只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even like them. I was just...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.87,0:15:39.18,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 他们都叫你新来的 对吧? 那我就懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. You're the new kid, right? Now I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.55,0:15:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么可懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing to get.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.27,0:15:43.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟你闹着玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just messing with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.59,0:15:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫贝弗利·马什\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Beverly Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.91,0:15:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我认识你的 我们一起上过课的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know that 'cause we're in the same class.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,社会课 你叫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Social Studies. And you were...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.59,0:15:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫本 不过大家都叫我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ben. But pretty much everybody just calls me...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.39,0:15:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,新来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The new kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.07,0:16:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没事 本 这在绰号界算是好的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Ben, there are worse things to be called.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.59,0:16:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你签纪念册吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me sign this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢适应这吧 社会课的本同学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay cool, Ben from sosh class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.47,0:16:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,啊 我会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.47,0:16:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是 贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.99,0:16:32.02,Default,,0,0,0,,撑住 新街边男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang tough, new kid on the block.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.43,0:16:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"妹子别走"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Please Don't Go, Girl. "
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.11,0:16:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,这是新街边男孩的另一首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the name of another New Kids on the Block song.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,绕口令:只见他猛挥拳头往柱子上砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He thrusts his fists against the posts...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.95,0:16:58.51,Default,,0,0,0,,只见他猛挥拳头往 往…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He thrusts his fists against...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.75,0:17:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.15,0:17:06.15,Default,,0,0,0,,柱子上砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Post. "
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.91,0:17:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,用帮忙吗? 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need some help? I...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.35,0:17:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,之前我们不是说好了的么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we agreed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.67,0:17:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你先别急着说我… - 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Before you say anything... - Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.31,0:17:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,先看看我的想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me show you something first.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.19,0:17:46.54,Default,,0,0,0,,荒地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Barrens.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.99,0:17:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,在那我们一定能找到乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the only place that Georgie could have ended up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.27,0:17:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.71,0:17:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,但若真是风暴给他刮跑了 我们应该去…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the storm swept Georgie in, we should have gone...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.91,0:17:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gone! He's dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.95,0:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 我们什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead! There is nothing we can do! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.27,0:18:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧把那堆玩意拆了 别让你妈妈看到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now take this down before your mother sees it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:20.01,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你下次想从我办公室拿什么东西的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next time you wanna take something from my office...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.19,0:18:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,必须经我允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.63,0:18:30.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你的管道又归你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess you get your tunnels back.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.71,0:19:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,上车啊 小妞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.91,0:19:02.91,Default,,0,0,0,,变态\N{\fnArial\fs30}Creep!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.15,0:19:13.21,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.27,0:19:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.19,0:19:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, son!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.43,0:19:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,救我 烧过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! It burns!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.79,0:19:56.79,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.63,0:20:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,别他妈让我再看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay the fuck outta my town!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.83,0:20:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.19,0:20:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.71,0:20:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么就学不会呢 斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not studying, Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.83,0:21:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,大家会怎么看我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going to look?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.55,0:21:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,犹太教祭祀的亲儿子居然读不完《摩西五经》\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rabbi's son can't finish his own Torah reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.83,0:21:07.18,Default,,0,0,0,,把书放回到我办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the book to my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你根本没用心学\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously you're not using it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.99,0:23:06.96,Default,,0,0,0,,除了特价小吃什么都可以拿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take everything but the Delicious Deals, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.99,0:23:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我妈妈喜欢吃那些小吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom loves them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.31,0:23:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 起初你说去荒地 现在你又说去下水道里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! First you said the Barrens, and now you're saying the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.19,0:23:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们被抓了怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what if we get caught?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.91,0:23:17.47,Default,,0,0,0,,不会的 埃迪 下水道属于为百姓而建的市政工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't, Eds. The sewers are public works.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不也是老百姓嘛 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're the public, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.47,0:23:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪 这些是避孕药吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eddie, these your birth control pills?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.51,0:23:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,对 给你妹用的 这是私人物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and I'm saving it for your sister. This is private stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.15,0:23:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我的小埃迪熊 你和朋友们赶着去哪啊?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Bear, where you boys off to in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.43,0:23:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,呃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.79,0:23:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,去我 我 我家后院 卡斯布拉克夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just my backyard, Mrs. K.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.39,0:23:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我买了新的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a new...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.67,0:23:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 新槌球套装 - 天啊 你就不能说话利索点儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A new croquet set. - Jeez, spit it out, Bill!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,准了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.39,0:23:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝儿 千万别在草上打滚哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and sweetie, don't go rolling around on the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.91,0:23:54.62,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是刚割过的草\N{\fnArial\fs30}Especially if it's just been cut.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.43,0:23:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,要是过敏症犯了可有你受的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how bad your allergies can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.47,0:23:58.82,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命 母上 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Mom. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.07,0:24:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你是不是忘了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you forgetting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.15,0:24:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯布拉克女士 要不要我也亲你一口呀?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want one from me too, Mrs. K?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.55,0:24:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是开个玩笑 - 不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was kidding. - No, no, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.63,0:24:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 母上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, Mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.71,0:24:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,"君之红发婉如冬日烈火 而燃至柳月的余烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your hair is winter fire, January embers...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.35,0:24:46.46,Default,,0,0,0,,亦为我心焚炼之地"\N{\fnArial\fs30}My heart burns there too. "
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.67,0:24:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,骑慢点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.91,0:24:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,银神驹 冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi-ho, Silver!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.87,0:24:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,冲啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Away!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.07,0:24:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你那老自行车居然比们的还快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your old lady bike's too fast for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.19,0:24:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,书给你找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.43,0:24:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们现在不是放暑假呢吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't it summer vacation?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.31,0:25:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉着你应该出去玩玩 别整天泡在书堆里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would think you'd be ready to take a break from the books.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:01.41,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢在这读书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like it in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.59,0:25:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,男孩儿嘛 暑假就应该找朋友们一起出去玩耍\N{\fnArial\fs30}A boy should be spending his summer outside with friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.63,0:25:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有朋友吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you have any friends?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.83,0:25:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,能把书给我了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I have the book now?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.07,0:28:14.21,Default,,0,0,0,,拿蛋的小胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Egg boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.03,0:28:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你在这干什么呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What on earth are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.75,0:28:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪啊 大胸仔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you off to, tits?
