Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.39,0:37:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.43,0:38:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得如何?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.11,0:38:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦 这么说如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.71,0:38:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你戴上眼镜就像是露易丝·莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look just like Lois Lane.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.55,0:38:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.47,0:38:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.03,0:38:19.34,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦 还给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.91,0:38:22.18,Default,,0,0,0,,该死 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoot, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.87,0:38:23.93,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.19,0:38:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,快吮吸伤口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just suck the wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.43,0:38:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我得集中注意力 - 你还得集中注意力?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need to focus right now. - You need to focus?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.55,0:38:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,对 你能帮我拿点东西过来吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can you go get me something?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.91,0:38:43.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 你需要什么? - 去拿我的近远视双用镜\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jesus! What do you need? - Go get my bifocals.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.11,0:38:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,在我第二个腰包里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hid 'em in my second fanny pack.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.43,0:38:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么有两个腰包?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have two fanny packs?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.03,0:38:48.72,Default,,0,0,0,,说来话长 不过我现在得专心救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to focus right now and it's a long story.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.75,0:38:49.87,Default,,0,0,0,,反正我也不想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to get into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.19,0:39:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那个 谢 谢 谢谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.43,0:39:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我们扯平啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even-steven.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.67,0:39:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 他在流血 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, he's bleeding. Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.27,0:39:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,社会课的本同学?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben from sosh?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.43,0:39:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你必须先吮吸好伤口才能上绷带\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to suck the wound before you apply the Band-Aids.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.99,0:39:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是常识 - 你别在这不懂装懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is 101. - You don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.99,0:39:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗? 伤看着挺重啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you okay? That looks like it hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.19,0:39:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我没事 就是刚才摔了一跤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. No, I'm good. I just fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.35,0:39:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,对 摔到亨利·鲍尔斯的刀上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, right into Henry Bowers.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.91,0:39:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,别瞎说 里 里 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.59,0:39:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么不说? 我又没胡诌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why? It's the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.43,0:39:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你确定他们治疗你的时候没乱用药品?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure they got the right stuff to fix you up?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.27,0:39:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我 我们会照顾好他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we'll take care of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.03,0:39:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,再次感谢 贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, thanks again, Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.51,0:39:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不客气 有缘再会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. Maybe I'll see you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.67,0:39:40.70,Default,,0,0,0,,好啊 我们明天可能会想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we were thinking about...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.87,0:39:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,去矿 矿 矿场\N{\fnArial\fs30}going to the quarry tomorrow,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.67,0:39:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你也想…\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.79,0:39:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,来的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}come.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.51,0:39:48.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道了 谢谢你的邀请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to know. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.63,0:39:54.43,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 在她面前提及鲍尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice going bringing up Bowers in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.63,0:39:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,说的对 你不知道她们以前的事?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, dude, you heard what she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.87,0:39:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,以前她干了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.15,0:39:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你该问她干了谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}More like "Who'd she do?"
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.43,0:40:01.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说她上过的人的名单比我的丁丁都长\N{\fnArial\fs30}From what I hear, the list is longer than my wang.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.83,0:40:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那也没多少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not saying much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.59,0:40:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那只 只 只是谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.59,0:40:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,总之呢 比尔三年级的时候就跟她扯上过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, Bill had her back in third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.67,0:40:10.91,Default,,0,0,0,,他们在学校舞台剧上接吻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kissed in the school play.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.03,0:40:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,评论上都说他俩接吻时的激情可不是演出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The reviews said you can't fake that sort of passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.67,0:40:16.15,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们看 在这发现个胖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, pip-pip and tally-ho, my good fellows,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.63,0:40:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我想这胖子需要我们全力帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do believe this chap requires our utmost attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.71,0:40:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯布拉克医生 赶紧去救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in there, Dr. K. Come on, fix him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.51,0:40:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,还用得着你这个卷毛脑袋废话 我知道我该干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you shut the fuck up, Einstein, because I know what I'm doing...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.55,0:40:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我很不喜欢你模仿英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I don't want you doing the British guy with me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.19,0:40:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,赶紧吮吸伤口吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suck the wound. Get in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.99,0:40:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,马桶和浴缸的废水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toilet and bath water travel down...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.03,0:40:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,从管道流入下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}the drains and into the sewer.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.47,0:40:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你的伙伴们在下水道里玩会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sewer is a fun place to play with all of your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.19,0:40:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,跟着废水一起进入管道 然后看废水都流到哪去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow the water into the drains and down into the sewers you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.83,0:40:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你和伙伴们在下水道玩的时候 就像小丑一样傻的可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're with your friends in the sewers, you can be as silly as a clown!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.55,0:40:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,说的对 这就是我们节目今天的主题\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right, it's the word of the day.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.15,0:40:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.67,0:40:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 小贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.39,0:40:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你手里拿的什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatcha got there?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.03,0:40:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就是些小玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.75,0:40:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,什么小玩意?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.75,0:41:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉我 你还是我的小宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you're still my little girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:23.71,0:41:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.83,0:41:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:31.79,Default,,0,0,0,,左上的高弧掷球 这是他最后一次击球机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}A deep fly ball to the left. His last at bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.03,0:41:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,球擦棒而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He scratched the foul pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.27,0:41:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,韦德·博格斯 毫无疑问他的击球冠绝联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wade Boggs, of course, leads the league in hitting so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.95,0:41:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你喜欢这头发 我就全剪掉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you did. This is what you...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.99,0:41:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.79,0:42:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.67,0:42:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 小菜一碟 - 可怜的小树\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So easy. - Poor tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.23,0:42:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,超简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}So easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.35,0:42:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 你痰吐的真烂 我赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, that was terrible. I win.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.23,0:42:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你赢了? - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You won? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.51,0:42:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你看到我吐的痰了么 - 我的痰飞得最远\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Did you see my loogie? - That went the farthest!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.71,0:42:50.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 吐痰凭距离决胜负 - 是凭量 一直都是凭量决胜负\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's by distance. - Mass. It's always been mass.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.43,0:42:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,什么是量?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is mass?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.95,0:42:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,吐多远都无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who cares how far it goes?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.39,0:42:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,关键是它看起来酷不酷 是绿的还是白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It matters how cool it looks, like it's green or it's white...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.63,0:42:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,唾沫是不是多 痰够不够浓\N{\fnArial\fs30}or juicy and fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.65,0:42:57.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Thanks for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.67,0:42:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁第一个跳 - 太可怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who's first? - That was terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.39,0:43:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.83,0:43:09.83,Default,,0,0,0,,一群胆小鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sissies.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.43,0:43:15.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我勒个去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.59,0:43:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,操了 我们刚刚被一个女孩嘲笑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, holy shit! We just got showed up by a girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.07,0:43:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在是不是必须得跳了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have to do that now?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.43,0:43:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.75,0:43:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,跳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.55,0:43:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.15,0:43:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我赢了 我们已经赢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already won! We already won!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.23,0:43:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们倒了 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're down! Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.39,0:44:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,天 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, fuck! What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.07,0:44:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,刚刚不知什么东西碰到了我的脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something just touched my foot right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:17.19,0:44:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么啦?\N{\fnArial\fs30}That work?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.39,0:44:20.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 在哪? - 在这 在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we looking? - Right here, right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.19,0:44:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,一只乌龟而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a turtle.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.47,0:44:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉你个新闻 本同学 现在学校已经放暑假了\N{\fnArial\fs30}News flash, Ben. School's out for summa!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.79,0:44:58.30,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 那 那可不是学校的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? That's not school stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.43,0:45:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这是谁送你的? - 没谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who sent you this? - No one. Give it...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.47,0:45:02.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.07,0:45:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你收集这些旧报纸做什么? - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's with the history project? - Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.75,0:45:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我刚搬来这里的时候 没人跟我一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I first moved here, I didn't have anyone to hang out with,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.67,0:45:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我只好在图书馆里打发时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I just started spending time in the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.55,0:45:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你去了图书馆?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You went to the library?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.11,0:45:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,那能有什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}On purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.59,0:45:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我想看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I wanna see.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.99,0:45:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,黑斑点是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's The Black Spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.59,0:45:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,黑斑点是一个夜总会\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Spot was a nightclub...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:26.91,0:45:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,在十年前被狂热的种族主义者烧毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that was burned down years ago by that racist cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.83,0:45:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The what?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.27,0:45:31.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你不看热拉尔多的节目吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you watch Geraldo?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.63,0:45:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你 你的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hair...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.83,0:45:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你的头发真漂亮 贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your... Your hair is beautiful, Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.87,0:45:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.95,0:45:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.19,0:45:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,来 给我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, pass it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.63,0:45:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,这怎么都是关于凶杀案和儿童失踪案的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it all murders and missing kids?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.79,0:45:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,德里镇和我之前去过的任何一个镇都大不相同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Derry's not like any town I've ever been in before.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.03,0:46:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,有人做过研究 研究显示\N{\fnArial\fs30}They did a study once, and it turns out...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.83,0:46:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这里人口失踪率和死亡率是全国平均水平的六倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}people die or disappear six times the national average.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.23,0:46:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你读过那篇研究?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You read that?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.23,0:46:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,不只是大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's just grown-ups.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.23,0:46:12.86,Default,,0,0,0,,孩子们处境更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kids are worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.31,0:46:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,非常 非常糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Way, way worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.19,0:46:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们还想看 我家里还有更多资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got more stuff if you wanna see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.39,0:46:20.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.59,0:46:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不要怕 告诉我们就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't freak out, just tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:51.43,0:46:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我听说他有一辆过山车 一只宠物猩猩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I heard he has a rollercoaster and a pet chimp...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.95,0:46:56.70,Default,,0,0,0,,和一个老人的骨头 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and an old guy's fucking bones. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.39,0:46:59.61,Default,,0,0,0,,哇 哇 哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.83,0:47:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.11,0:47:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我的房间很赞吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.79,0:47:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,不 没什么可赞的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, nothing cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:05.15,0:47:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,真心没什么好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.79,0:47:11.54,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 这很赞 等等 不 看错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is cool, right here. Wait, no. No, it's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.79,0:47:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.27,0:47:16.06,Default,,0,0,0,,那个? 那是德里镇的建镇许可状\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? That's the charter for Derry Township.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.27,0:47:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,发现书呆子一枚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nerd alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.99,0:47:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,其实它背后的故事还是挺有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually, it's really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.59,0:47:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,起初德里镇就是一个诱捕海狸的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Derry started as a beaver trapping camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.47,0:47:24.62,Default,,0,0,0,,现在也是啊 我说的对吗 兄弟们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still is, am I right, boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.79,0:47:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,91个人签署了《建镇许可状》后就有了现在的德里镇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ninety-one people signed the charter that made Derry.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.63,0:47:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但于同年冬天 他们都消失得无影无踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But later that winter, they all disappeared without a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.63,0:47:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,整个镇吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The entire camp?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.27,0:47:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,有传闻说是印第安人干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were rumors of Indians,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.11,0:47:37.30,Default,,0,0,0,,但并未发现小镇有受到袭击的迹象\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no sign of an attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.31,0:47:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都认为定是遭遇了瘟疫或是什么别的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody just thought it was a plague or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.35,0:47:42.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但感觉像\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.47,0:47:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,某一天 大家一觉醒来后就都走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}one day everybody just woke up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.47,0:47:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,唯一的线索是一些血衣 断断续续散在地上直至井房\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only clue was a trail of bloody clothes leading to the well house.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.15,0:47:53.95,Default,,0,0,0,,上帝啊 我们可以续写《未解之谜》了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus. We can get Derry on Unsolved Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.99,0:47:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那就写吧 你可是个天才 - 也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's do that. You're brilliant. - I might be.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.99,0:48:05.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.19,0:48:08.57,Default,,0,0,0,,也许他只是想交一些朋友 斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he's just trying to make some friends, Stanley.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.35,0:48:10.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那个井房在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where was the well house?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.75,0:48:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不知道 可能是在镇上的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Somewhere in town, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.39,0:48:15.42,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.67,0:48:16.81,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.63,0:48:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,没有人能与我感同身受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows the trouble I've seen...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.35,0:48:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,没人知道我的悲伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody knows my sorrow...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.67,0:49:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie...
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.95,0:49:23.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.07,0:49:27.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:28.27,0:49:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼 我妈会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck. My mom's gonna fucking flip.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.75,0:49:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得这药对我有用吗 埃迪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think this will help me, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.23,0:50:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.99,0:50:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪 你要去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where you going, Eds?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:24.67,0:50:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你住在这 那你已经到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you lived here, you'd be home by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.47,0:50:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,来一起做小丑吧 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come join the clown, Eds.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.35,0:50:33.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你会在这里漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.27,0:50:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都在这儿漂浮着\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all float down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.35,0:50:37.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我们漂浮着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:33.03,0:51:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,君之红发婉如冬日烈火\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Your hair is winter fire...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.43,0:51:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,而燃至柳月的余烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}"January embers...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:39.51,0:51:41.97,Default,,0,0,0,,亦为我心焚炼之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}"My heart burns there, too. "
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.79,0:51:56.01,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.11,0:52:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.55,0:52:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.15,0:52:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,请救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.55,0:52:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都很想见你 贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all want to meet you, Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.59,0:52:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都在下面漂浮着呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all float down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.19,0:52:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,谁在说话? 是谁?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello? Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.47,0:52:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我是维罗妮卡 - 贝蒂·瑞普森\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm Veronica. - Betty Ripsom.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.71,0:52:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,帕特里克·霍克斯德特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patrick Hockstetter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.95,0:52:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,再靠近些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.15,0:52:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你想看看吗? - 我们在漂浮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wanna see? - We float.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.51,0:52:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We change.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.79,0:53:51.79,Default,,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.95,0:53:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.27,0:53:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,救命啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.71,0:54:31.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿他妈的发生了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The hell's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.87,0:54:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,水池…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sink...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.15,0:54:41.70,Default,,0,0,0,,那里有血 在那…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the blood... It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.07,0:54:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,什么血\N{\fnArial\fs30}What blood?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.39,0:54:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,水池里 你没看见吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sink. You don't see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.07,0:54:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那里面有血\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.95,0:55:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我很操心 贝弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worry me, Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.95,0:55:05.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你真的让我很操心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You worry me a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:06.07,0:55:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你看不到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.11,0:55:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要剪短头发?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you do this to your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.63,0:55:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,看着像是个男孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Makes you look like a boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.71,0:57:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.23,0:58:30.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我把船弄丢了 比尔 不要生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost it, Billy. Don't be mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.91,0:58:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有生你的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not mad at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.11,0:58:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是在漂浮\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just floated off.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.99,0:58:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但是 比尔 如果你跟我一起走的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Bill, if you'll come with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.63,0:58:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.99,0:58:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:58.31,0:59:00.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too. You'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:00.31,0:59:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.47,0:59:04.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你也会漂浮起来 - 你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You'll float, too. - You'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.43,0:59:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too. You'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.67,0:59:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.15,0:59:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too! You'll float, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.95,0:59:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.79,0:59:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你也会漂浮起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll float, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.19,0:59:35.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我们必须穿过巷子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we gotta go through the alleyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.51,0:59:36.76,Default,,0,0,0,,巷子太长了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alley takes way too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.79,0:59:38.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不 巷子快得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the alley is so much faster.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.35,0:59:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,巷子更危险 更讨厌\N{\fnArial\fs30}The alley is more dangerous and it's disgusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.87,0:59:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么可能会危险?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it more dangerous?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.15,0:59:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这闻起来像狗屎 还很恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells like piss and it's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:42.71,0:59:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我就是不喜欢 怎样? - 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just take the side streets for once. - Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.63,0:59:47.19,Default,,0,0,0,,所以你就决定不喜欢这样的事情 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}The side streets are the same. They smell like piss and shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.35,0:59:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 她要说的那件事实际上是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay. Can you just tell me what she said exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.67,0:59:50.80,Default,,0,0,0,,她什么也没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.83,0:59:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他就是说你们得快点过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She just said that you guys need to hurry over.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.03,0:59:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,她什么也没说 好 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't say anything. Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.31,0:59:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们到了 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.35,0:59:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我需要给你们看些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to show you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.11,0:59:59.17,Default,,0,0,0,,看什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,比在采石场露的还多?\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than we saw at the quarry?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.71,1:00:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴吧你 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up! Just shut up, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.63,1:00:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我爸发现我带男孩子进家 他会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad will kill me if he finds out I had boys in the apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.99,1:00:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我 我们会留下人望风\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll leave a lookout.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.07,1:00:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,里奇 你留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie, stay here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.47,1:00:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,喂喂喂 要是她爸爸回来了怎么办?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa! What if her dad comes back?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.47,1:00:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,向他展现你嘴炮本色\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what you always do. Start talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.91,1:00:20.13,Default,,0,0,0,,这可是一种天赋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.31,1:00:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}In there.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.87,1:00:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,那里面有什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.51,1:00:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你会看到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll see.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.91,1:00:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,很好 把我们带去洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you taking us to your bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.75,1:00:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你难道不知道89%的意外事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want you to know that 89% of the worst accidents in homes...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.23,1:00:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,都是在厨房或者洗手间发生的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}are caused in bathrooms.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.35,1:00:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那里面滋生超级多的细菌和真菌…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, I mean, that's where all the bacteria and fungi are...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.27,1:00:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,可不是个卫生的地方…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's not a really sanitary place...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.91,1:00:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.43,1:00:52.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你们有看到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.67,1:00:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - What...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.59,1:00:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,这里发生了什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.95,1:00:59.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸爸看不到这些 我当时觉得可能是我疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad couldn't see it. I thought I might be crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.59,1:01:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是你疯了 那么我们也都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you're crazy, then we're all crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.11,1:01:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得帮她把这里清理干净\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't leave it like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.99,1:02:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,你从来没去过德里镇的夏日集市吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so you've never been to the Derry Summer Fair?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.67,1:02:25.86,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.95,1:02:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我记着应该是没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not that I know of.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.03,1:02:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我每年都去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I go there every year,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.35,1:02:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,有一次我和里奇去的 我击中了靶心获得头奖\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was there one time with Richie and technically won 'cause I hit the target.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.71,1:02:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,但是奖品太多了 我都不知道该选 选哪个\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there were so many prizes, I didn't know which to pick.
