Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.31,1:02:47.62,Default,,0,0,0,,那都不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they say about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.31,1:02:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我只被一个男人吻过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was only ever kissed by one guy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.51,1:02:57.34,Default,,0,0,0,,那是在很久很久之前的事情了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.39,1:03:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,不过那一吻我一直记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a nice kiss though.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.19,1:03:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,燃至柳月的余烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}"January embers. "
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.67,1:03:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,是当时那舞台剧中的台词吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that in the play?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.67,1:03:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,不 是一首诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, the poem.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.55,1:03:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.07,1:03:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我读过的诗 诗并不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't really know much poetry.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.51,1:03:26.50,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. I was just...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.55,1:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,当我没说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never mind then.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.75,1:03:34.89,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:35.71,1:03:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是想让你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.75,1:03:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我从来不相信那些谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never believed any of the rumors.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.95,1:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我们这群人都不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And none of us Losers do.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:47.59,1:03:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们喜欢和你一起玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}We like hanging with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.59,1:03:52.78,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.03,1:03:54.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你不用总是对我们说谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You shouldn't thank us too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:55.19,1:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,总和我们玩 你会被划成我们同一类人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanging out with us makes you a Loser, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.87,1:04:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take that.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.03,1:04:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不 我是真太乐意做你们的私人门卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I love being your personal doorman, really.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.11,1:04:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你们这帮蠢货还能再磨蹭一点吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you idiots have taken any longer?
