Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.15,1:04:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她没有瞎想\N{\fnArial\fs30}She didn't imagine it.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.47,1:04:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.07,1:04:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我也看见了一些诡异的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw something, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.31,1:04:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你也看见血了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw blood, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:32.31,1:04:33.45,Default,,0,0,0,,不是血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not blood.
