Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.83,1:04:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,感觉很真实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seemed so real.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.07,1:04:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我是说 它看着很像乔治 但是那其实是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it seemed like him, but there was this...
