Dialogue: 0,1:04:52.11,1:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 我也看见他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I saw him, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.51,1:05:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 是不是只有处子之身才能看到这些东西?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, can only virgins see this stuff?
