Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.47,1:07:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢你们 但是你们不该惹那伙人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys, but you shouldn't have done that.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.43,1:07:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也会对付你们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be after you guys, too, now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.15,1:07:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍尔斯 他一直都想对付我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, no, no. Bowers? He's always after us.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.15,1:07:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我们的共 共 共同点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's one thing we all have in common.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.51,1:07:50.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊 家里蹲骚年 欢迎加入废柴俱乐部\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, Homeschool. Welcome to the Losers' Club.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.91,1:07:55.91,Default,,0,0,0,,在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right there.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.83,1:08:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他们说 他们在水管旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}They say they found part of his hand...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.03,1:08:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,找到了他被啃剩下的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}all chewed up near the Standpipe.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.83,1:08:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,他曾向我借过铅笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked to borrow a pencil once.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:10.79,1:08:13.17,Default,,0,0,0,,她似乎已被遗 遗 遗忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like she's been forgotten...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:13.43,1:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为现在人们关注的是科科伦失踪案\N{\fnArial\fs30}because Corcoran's missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.39,1:08:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这事能有完吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it ever gonna end?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:18.59,1:08:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,兄弟 你干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck, dude?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.15,1:08:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在讲什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you guys talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.07,1:08:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,还不是之前他们讲的那件事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}What they always talk about.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.03,1:08:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,其实我觉得这事会结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}I actually think it will end.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.67,1:08:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,至少会消停一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}For a little while, at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.39,1:08:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你是什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.67,1:08:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我仔细检查了我搜集到的德里镇资料\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I was going over all my Derry research...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:31.59,1:08:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,标注出了所有的大事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I charted out all the big events.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.39,1:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,1908年钢铁厂爆炸事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Ironworks explosion in 1908,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.63,1:08:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,1935年布拉德利团伙覆灭事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Bradley Gang in '35,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.55,1:08:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,1962年黑斑点俱乐部焚毁事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}and The Black Spot in '62.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.83,1:08:41.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还有现在孩子失踪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now kids being...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:44.87,1:08:47.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我发现这些大事件似乎是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realized this stuff seems to happen...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.59,1:08:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,每隔27年发生一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.27,1:08:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 那我来梳理一下整件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so, let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.87,1:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,在一年之中 小丑会到处吃孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It comes out from wherever to eat kids for, like, a year?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.35,1:08:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,然后呢? 再休眠27年?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then what? It just goes into hibernation?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.43,1:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这就像… 那个东西叫什么来着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's like... What do you call it?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.15,1:09:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,蝉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cicadas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.47,1:09:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,蝉每隔十七年出来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the bugs that come out once every 17 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.63,1:09:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我爷爷认为这个镇子被诅咒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandfather thinks this town is cursed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.47,1:09:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,他说\N{\fnArial\fs30}He says that...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.83,1:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,就因为某种东西的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the bad things that happen in this town...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.75,1:09:14.42,Default,,0,0,0,,所有的坏事情都在这个小镇发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}are because of one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.59,1:09:17.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一个以德里镇人为食的邪恶的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}An evil thing that feeds off the people of Derry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.99,1:09:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉着不可能只是一种怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it can't be one thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:20.79,1:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到的怪物都不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all saw something different.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:23.11,1:09:24.11,Default,,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.31,1:09:26.71,Default,,0,0,0,,或者它让我们看到我们最害怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe It knows what scares us most and that's what we see.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.11,1:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我看到了一个麻风病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw a leper.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.11,1:09:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,他就像是一个行走的感染源\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was like a walking infection.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.95,1:09:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,但其实你根本没遇到这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.79,1:09:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,因为那怪物不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.83,1:09:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,全都是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this is.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.87,1:09:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪看到的麻风病人是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Eddie's leper...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.31,1:09:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔看到的乔治也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}or Bill seeing Georgie...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.95,1:09:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我总能看到的那个女人也是幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the woman I keep seeing.
