Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.15,1:09:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.95,1:09:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,她不性感\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's not hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:52.63,1:09:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,她的脸很恐怖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her face is all messed up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.55,1:09:59.06,Default,,0,0,0,,这些事没一样能讲得通\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.71,1:10:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,它们都像噩梦一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're all like bad dreams.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.47,1:10:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得不对 我知道现实与噩梦的区别 好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think so. I know the difference between a bad dream and real life, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.03,1:10:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到了什么? 你也看到了不好的东西吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What'd you see? You saw something, too?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.51,1:10:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.31,1:10:14.87,Default,,0,0,0,,你们知道哈里斯大街上烧毁的那栋房子吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys know that burned-down house on Harris Avenue?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:16.59,1:10:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,大火烧楼的时候 我被困在里面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was inside when it burned down.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.03,1:10:23.03,Default,,0,0,0,,在我获救之前…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before I was rescued,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.23,1:10:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我爸妈都被困在隔壁的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}my mom and dad were trapped in the next room over from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.87,1:10:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,他们大力地推门 砸门\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were pushing and pounding on the door,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.83,1:10:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,试图找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.51,1:10:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,快点 儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry, son!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.83,1:10:37.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我快被烧死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It burns!
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.91,1:10:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,但是火势太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it was too hot.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.95,1:10:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等消防员们找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the firemen finally found them,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.27,1:10:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的手已被烧得可以看到骨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}the skin on their hands had melted down to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.55,1:10:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都有惧怕的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all afraid of something.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.71,1:10:58.15,Default,,0,0,0,,这话说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got that right.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.79,1:11:00.70,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了里奇 你害怕什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, Rich? What are you afraid of?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.19,1:11:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clowns.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.87,1:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.23,1:11:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.07,1:11:42.06,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治就是在那里失踪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Georgie disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.23,1:11:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,钢铁厂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's the Ironworks.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.27,1:11:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,黑斑点夜总会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And The Black Spot.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.75,1:11:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,所有坏事发生的地方 都有下水道连接\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everywhere it happens, it's all connected by the sewers.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.71,1:11:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,而那些下水管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they all meet up at the...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.95,1:11:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,汇集点就是井房\N{\fnArial\fs30}The well house.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.35,1:11:59.79,Default,,0,0,0,,是内波特街上的那栋房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's in the house on Neibolt Street.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.47,1:12:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你是说瘾君子和流浪汉那类货色们聚集的那个鬼屋?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean that creepy-ass house where all the junkies and hobos like to sleep?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.15,1:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢那个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate that place.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.75,1:12:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我总觉得里面有什么东西在看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always feels like it's watching me.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.43,1:12:10.59,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是在那里看到它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where I saw It.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.35,1:12:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我在那看见一个小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where I saw the clown.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.95,1:12:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那 那 那就是它的老巢\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where It lives.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.31,1:12:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我想象出有什么东西会想住在那种地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't imagine anything ever wanting to live there.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.79,1:12:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我们可不可以不要谈这个话题了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we stop talking about this?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.27,1:12:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我快不能呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can barely breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.43,1:12:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这是暑假\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is summer.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:26.79,1:12:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们是小孩 我快不能呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're kids. I can barely breathe.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.63,1:12:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈哮喘病都要发作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm up here having a fucking asthma attack.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.47,1:12:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不想再看这个破玩意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not doing this.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.47,1:12:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,搞什么 把地图贴回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? Put the map back.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.55,1:12:35.55,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-mmm.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.43,1:12:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.27,1:12:45.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这是怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.31,1:12:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道 快看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.31,1:12:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.71,1:12:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.31,1:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.35,1:13:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.35,1:13:20.49,Default,,0,0,0,,是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's It!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:21.83,1:13:24.82,Default,,0,0,0,,那他妈的是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck is that? What the fuck is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.31,1:13:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈也不知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't fucking know!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.91,1:13:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,关了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn it off! Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.87,1:13:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,快关了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, turn it off. Turn it off!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:53.87,1:13:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦利 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Stanley!
Dialogue: 0,1:13:57.27,1:13:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:58.83,1:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么搞的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:14.91,1:14:16.05,Default,,0,0,0,,本 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.27,1:14:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,它看见我们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It saw us.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.75,1:14:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,它能看见我们 它知道我们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}It saw us, and it knows where we are.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.87,1:14:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,它一直知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}It always did.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:24.23,1:14:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我们出发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.75,1:14:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,出发?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.47,1:14:29.47,Default,,0,0,0,,去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go where?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.71,1:14:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,内波特街\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neibolt.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.27,1:14:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,乔 乔 乔治就在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's where Georgie is.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.71,1:14:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们刚逃过一劫 还去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:36.59,1:14:38.89,Default,,0,0,0,,是的 现在是暑假 我们都应该呆在外面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, it's summer. We should be outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.07,1:14:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的别再跟我提现在是暑 暑 暑假\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you say it's summer one more fucking time...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:47.67,1:14:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.63,1:14:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:21.15,1:15:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,只见他猛 猛挥拳头\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He thrusts his fists...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.91,1:15:26.86,Default,,0,0,0,,往柱 柱 柱子上砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"against the posts...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.11,1:15:30.26,Default,,0,0,0,,直说自己把鬼 鬼 鬼碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and still insists he sees..."
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.51,1:15:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.47,1:15:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 你不能进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, you can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.51,1:15:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.79,1:15:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,听着 你们不用非得跟我一起进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you don't have to come in with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.47,1:15:42.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是当另一个乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what happens when another Georgie goes missing?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.53,1:15:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,或是另一个贝蒂 另一个科科伦 又或是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or another Betty? Or another Ed Corcoran? Or...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.20,1:15:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我们几个其中之一失踪\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of us?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.77,1:15:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,你们打算像镇子里的其他人一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you just gonna pretend it isn't happening...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.40,1:15:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,假装什么事情都没发生吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}like everyone else in this town?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.23,1:15:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I can't.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.67,1:16:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我回到家就不由自主地想到失踪的乔治\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go home, and all I see is that Georgie isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.15,1:16:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,他的衣服 他的玩具 那些傻傻的动物毛绒玩偶都在家\N{\fnArial\fs30}His clothes, his toys, his stupid stuffed animals, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.83,1:16:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He isn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.75,1:16:12.74,Default,,0,0,0,,所以对于我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So walking into this house,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.67,1:16:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,走进这间房子\N{\fnArial\fs30}for me,
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.63,1:16:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,比走进我自己家更容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's easier than walking into my own.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.51,1:16:25.51,Default,,0,0,0,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:25.71,1:16:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.95,1:16:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他刚才一点也没结巴\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't stutter once.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:32.55,1:16:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.03,1:16:36.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um...
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.63,1:16:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,呃 我们不需要望风的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shouldn't we have some people keep watch?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.03,1:16:44.70,Default,,0,0,0,,就是…为了以防万一\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, just in case something bad happens?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.83,1:16:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,谁 谁 谁想留在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who wants to stay out here?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.67,1:16:58.67,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.59,1:17:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我真不敢相信我抽到了下下签\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe I pulled the short straw.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:10.71,1:17:12.51,Default,,0,0,0,,要是按丁丁的长度来的话 倒霉的就是你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are lucky you're not measuring dicks.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.67,1:17:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.55,1:17:19.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我闻到它了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can smell it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.67,1:17:21.31,Default,,0,0,0,,不要用嘴呼吸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't breathe through your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:21.39,1:17:22.39,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.91,1:17:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你在吃它的残渣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because then you're eating it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:51.27,1:17:52.27,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:53.03,1:17:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这上面说我失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It... It says I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:56.55,1:17:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你 你 你没有失踪 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not missing, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.11,1:17:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,德里市警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Police department, City of Derry. "
Dialogue: 0,1:17:59.71,1:18:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我的衬衫 我的发型 是我的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my shirt. That's my hair. That's my face.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.47,1:18:03.55,Default,,0,0,0,,冷静 这都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, this isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:03.71,1:18:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,有我的名字 我的年龄 还有日期…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my name. That's my age! That's the date!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:05.11,1:18:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be real, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.31,1:18:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这他妈的是什么? 上面写着我失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it says it! What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:07.95,1:18:10.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我失踪了吗? - 冷静一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Am I missing? Am I gonna go missing? - Calm down. Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:10.71,1:18:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,看着我 里奇 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me, Richie. Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:13.63,1:18:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That... That isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.71,1:18:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,它在戏弄我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's playing tricks on you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.55,1:18:19.77,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.11,1:18:24.58,Default,,0,0,0,,有人吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.83,1:18:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.19,1:19:08.19,Default,,0,0,0,,贝蒂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betty?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.79,1:19:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,瑞普森?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ripsom?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.19,1:19:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.19,1:19:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你在找什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking for?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:28.87,1:19:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 你们听到了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, can you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.75,1:19:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,她刚刚就在这 她他妈的去哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was just here. Where the fuck did she go?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.15,1:19:56.37,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:00.91,1:20:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:04.83,1:20:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.59,1:20:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,- 伙计们 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys! Guys! - What? Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.43,1:20:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.67,1:20:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,该吃药了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to take your pill, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.03,1:20:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 打开门 - 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie. Open the door! - Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.31,1:20:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你还好吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:44.47,1:20:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪 发生什么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.79,1:20:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eds.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.63,1:20:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.15,1:20:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:50.79,1:20:51.82,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.43,1:20:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.83,1:21:02.18,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.83,1:21:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:05.59,1:21:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不是在捉迷藏 蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not playing hide-and-seek, dipshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.87,1:21:11.98,Default,,0,0,0,,里奇?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.83,1:21:16.30,Default,,0,0,0,,里奇 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richie! Richie!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:16.47,1:21:17.63,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 开门 快开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, come on, open the door.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:17.71,1:21:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,打不开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It won't open!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:18.95,1:21:20.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 这到底是怎么回事? 里奇 - 我打不开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on? Richie! - I can't!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.67,1:21:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,打开门 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door, Rich.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.83,1:21:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:58.51,1:21:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,该死的小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid clowns.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.75,1:22:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.35,1:22:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ugh!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.23,1:22:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,发现你喽 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beep-beep, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.91,1:22:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get outta here.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.07,1:23:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,来玩看谁吐的远吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna play loogie?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.35,1:23:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,来漂浮吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time to float.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:34.47,1:24:35.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我的鞋呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my shoe?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.39,1:24:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我操 她的腿呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the fuck were her legs?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.47,1:24:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,这又是什么鬼?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit, what the fuck was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.51,1:24:45.51,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.71,1:24:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,记得那个失踪孩子的海报吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember the missing kid poster.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:47.19,1:24:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,那个不是真的 所以这个也不是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't real, so this isn't real.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.39,1:24:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,美味可口的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tasty, tasty, beautiful fear.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.91,1:24:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧 准备好了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:58.07,1:24:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.55,1:25:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.19,1:25:07.41,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.59,1:25:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.27,1:25:11.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- 埃迪呢? - 救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Eddie? - Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.71,1:25:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:15.39,1:25:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.35,1:25:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.19,1:25:21.19,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.43,1:25:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 这下你信了吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't real enough for you, Billy?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.19,1:25:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你还不信我是真的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not real enough for you?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.91,1:25:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.71,1:25:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治觉得我是真的哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was real enough for Georgie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.51,1:25:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.63,1:25:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 去救埃迪 - 去救埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get Eddie! - Get Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.39,1:25:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 我们快离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck! We gotta get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.39,1:26:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,带上埃迪 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get Eddie. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.91,1:26:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:02.11,1:26:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 不 不 不 不要 - 艾迪 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no, no! - Eddie, look at me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.23,1:26:06.06,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna get us! Guys!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.27,1:26:07.58,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.95,1:26:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:14.83,1:26:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:22.35,1:26:23.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:24.55,1:26:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,别让小丑跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him get away!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:36.47,1:26:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔 我们得先救埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill, we have to help Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:37.99,1:26:39.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:40.47,1:26:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,我来把手臂掰回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna snap your arm into place.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:42.15,1:26:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你别想碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rich, do not fucking touch me.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:43.47,1:26:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那么开始了 一 二 三 - 我说了别他妈碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay, one, two, three. - Do not touch me!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:48.47,1:26:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.31,1:26:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,是你们把他弄伤的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You. You did this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.07,1:26:56.74,Default,,0,0,0,,他身体很弱的你们知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how delicate he is.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.99,1:26:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我们被攻击了 卡斯布拉克夫人 - 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We were attacked, Mrs. K. - No. Don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.83,1:27:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 别想着怪别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't try and blame anyone else.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:05.27,1:27:06.54,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我来吧 - 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me help. - Get back!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.91,1:27:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我可是听过你的那些事的 马什小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I've heard of you, Miss Marsh.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.03,1:27:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你个脏女人别碰我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want a dirty girl like you touching my son.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:16.43,1:27:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,卡斯布拉克夫人 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs. K, I...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.19,1:27:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,别说了 都是小畜生 全都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You are all monsters. All of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.39,1:27:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪不会再和你们玩了 听见了吗 再也不会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Eddie is done with you. Do you hear? Done!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:50.31,1:27:51.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见那口井了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the well.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.55,1:27:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我 我 们已知那口井的位置了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know where it is...
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.71,1:27:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,下次我们会准备得更充分\N{\fnArial\fs30}and next time we'll be better prepared.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.55,1:27:57.55,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.39,1:27:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,没有下次了 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}No next time, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:00.95,1:28:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你疯了 - 怎么这么说?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're insane. - Why?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:02.91,1:28:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都清楚没人会来帮我们消灭它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all know no one else is going to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.63,1:28:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪刚才差点没命了 你再看看这倒霉孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie was nearly killed! And look at this motherfucker.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.11,1:28:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他流了那么多血\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's leaking Hamburger Helper!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.15,1:28:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,可是我们不能就让他这样逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't pretend it's gonna go away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.39,1:28:14.14,Default,,0,0,0,,本 你自己也说了 它每27年回来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben, you said it yourself, It comes back every 27 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.39,1:28:17.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好 那时候我都40岁了 早就不在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine! I'll be 40 and far away from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.27,1:28:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过你也想离开这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you wanted to get out of this town, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.39,1:28:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我说离开是想奔向更好的生活 不是逃离这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I wanna run towards something. Not away.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.91,1:28:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉打断一下 是谁让莫林·林沃德成为我们一员的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, who invited Molly Ringwald into the group?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.23,1:28:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,- 里奇… - 我们还是现实点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Richie... - I'm just saying, let's face facts.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.43,1:28:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,看看现实世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Real world.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.63,1:28:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治已经死了 别想把我们的命也搭进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie is dead. Stop trying to get us killed, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:33.47,1:28:34.47,Default,,0,0,0,,乔治没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Georgie's not dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.79,1:28:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,当初你没能救他 但现在你至少可以救你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't save him, but you can still save yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.75,1:28:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,不 收 收回你刚才的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, take it back.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.11,1:28:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你害怕 我们也都很怕 但是收回刚才的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared and we all are, but take it back!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.91,1:28:49.91,Default,,0,0,0,,比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bill!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.59,1:28:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,你个废物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a bunch of losers!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:53.79,1:28:55.12,Default,,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 里奇 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck off! - Richie, stop.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.15,1:28:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你俩都是废物 你们俩都会送命的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're just a bunch of losers and you'll get yourselves killed...
Dialogue: 0,1:28:57.27,1:28:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,- 就为了抓一个傻小丑 - 别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- trying to catch a fucking stupid clown. - Stop!
Dialogue: 0,1:29:02.39,1:29:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,"它"就是想看我们这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what It wants.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.43,1:29:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,"它"想让我们内讧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wants to divide us.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:08.63,1:29:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我们听见他出现时 是因为我们团结\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were all together when we hurt It.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:11.35,1:29:13.30,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我们才能活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.51,1:29:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是 但我想继续活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, I plan to keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.99,1:29:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦克… - 伙计们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike... - Guys...
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.19,1:29:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.95,1:29:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我爷爷是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My granddad was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.83,1:29:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我只是个旁观者 插不了手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm an outsider. Gotta stay that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.35,1:30:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 耶 得分 - 真准\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! Bonus! - Yeah, there we go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.23,1:30:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,换下一个靶子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the next target out there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.83,1:30:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,抓好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold it.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.07,1:30:59.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你们在干吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's going on here?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.59,1:31:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,按你的要求 帮你擦枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just cleaning your gun, like you asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.23,1:31:08.42,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我擦枪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're cleaning my gun, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.15,1:31:14.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 爸爸… - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dad... - Hey!
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.51,1:31:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你们几个再看看他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at him now, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:28.35,1:31:31.89,Default,,0,0,0,,只会玩点假把式算什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't nothing like a little fear to make a paper man crumble.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:42.35,1:31:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,来取药吗 埃迪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here for the refills, Eddie?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.71,1:31:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.95,1:31:54.52,Default,,0,0,0,,这些都没用 你知道的吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know it's all bullshit, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:54.55,1:31:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,什么没用?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:56.47,1:31:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你的药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your medication.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.03,1:31:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,都是安慰剂而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're placebos.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.55,1:32:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,安慰剂是什么意思?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's placebo mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:00.71,1:32:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,安慰剂就是扯淡的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Placebo means bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.23,1:32:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,你没有朋友吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No friends, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:07.43,1:32:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,你的石膏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your cast.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.99,1:32:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,上面没有签名之类的吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No signatures or anything?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.99,1:32:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,真可怜\N{\fnArial\fs30}So sad.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.31,1:32:14.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想把它弄脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want it to get dirty.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:15.75,1:32:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我给你签一个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll sign it for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.51,1:32:35.86,Default,,0,0,0,,亨利 你还好吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay, Henry?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:45.59,1:33:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我最喜欢的午后节目环节就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is my most favorite part of the afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.99,1:33:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,听你们的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting to know all about so many of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.11,1:33:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,有谁想分享自己的故事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there someone here that wants to share with us...
Dialogue: 0,1:33:54.23,1:33:56.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- 大家今天最开心的事是什么? - 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what they most enjoyed about today? - Me!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:56.19,1:33:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.51,1:33:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我今天见到小丑了 很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked seeing the clown.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:58.83,1:34:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 你们想见小丑?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did? You liked the clown?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:00.75,1:34:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.95,1:34:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,切尔茜呢 你喜欢什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of you?
Dialogue: 0,1:34:03.75,1:34:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢漂浮的泡泡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked when the bubbles float.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:05.27,1:34:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗? 我也喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did? Me too.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:07.35,1:34:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我喜欢看东西飘起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just love watching things float.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.79,1:34:10.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都飘起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all float.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:10.95,1:34:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.39,1:34:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是哦 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you will, too, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:14.67,1:34:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,享受美好的一天吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make it a wonderful day.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.71,1:34:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:18.87,1:34:21.10,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:21.67,1:34:23.38,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:23.59,1:34:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他 杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him. Kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.07,1:34:30.70,Default,,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 大家给他热烈鼓掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Give a big round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.75,1:34:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,干得好 亨利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, Henry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.51,1:34:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们杀光 把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all. Kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.91,1:34:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.23,1:34:48.94,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们杀光 把他们杀光 把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all! Kill them all! Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.51,1:34:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们杀光 把他们杀光 把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill them all! Kill them all! Kill them all!
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.43,1:35:17.81,Default,,0,0,0,,你偷偷摸摸地要去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you sneaking off to?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:23.83,1:35:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,不去哪 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nowhere, Daddy.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:27.31,1:35:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你特意打扮过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're looking prettied up.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:30.47,1:35:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有特意打扮 爸爸 我每天都是这样穿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not prettied up, Daddy. I wear this almost every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.75,1:35:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:50.75,1:35:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我很担心你 小贝弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know I worry about you, Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.99,1:35:55.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:55.67,1:36:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,有人和我说了些关于你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}People in town have been saying some things to me about you.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:01.51,1:36:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,说你整个暑假都和一帮男孩混在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sneaking around all summer long with a bunch of boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:05.11,1:36:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,一群人里就你一个女孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only girl in the pack.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:07.11,1:36:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,他们只是朋友 我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just friends, I swear.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:09.83,1:36:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道男孩子是怎么看你的 小贝弗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what's in boys' minds when they look at you, Bevvie.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:15.79,1:36:17.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我太懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know all too well.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:18.11,1:36:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My hand...
Dialogue: 0,1:36:20.11,1:36:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你和那些男孩在树林里做那种事吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you doing womanly things down in the woods with those boys?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.71,1:36:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,没 没有 你不用担心 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, nothing. You don't have to worry. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.95,1:36:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这是什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:32.43,1:36:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,没什么 只是一首诗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's nothing. It's just a poem.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:36.23,1:36:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,只是一首诗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just a poem?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.59,1:36:39.89,Default,,0,0,0,,那你怎么把它藏在你内衣抽屉里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you had to hide it in your underwear drawer.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:40.79,1:36:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么要藏在那种地方?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you have to hide it there?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:45.75,1:36:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,你还是我的小宝贝吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still my girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:47.63,1:36:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.83,1:36:49.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你说什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:50.47,1:36:52.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我说我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:55.43,1:36:56.49,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.99,1:36:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,走开 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get away, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.71,1:37:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,不 放手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:03.51,1:37:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:07.39,1:37:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那些男孩 他们知不知道你是我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those boys. Do they know that you're my...
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.27,1:38:37.82,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.99,1:39:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly!
Dialogue: 0,1:39:13.07,1:39:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 里奇 - 你想怎么着?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Richie. - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.95,1:39:18.22,Default,,0,0,0,,你看这个我在揍的人 我当他是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that guy I'm hitting? I'm pretending it's you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.51,1:39:20.65,Default,,0,0,0,,它捉走了贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:20.87,1:39:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你在说啥?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:23.79,1:39:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,是"它" 里奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}It, Richie.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.87,1:39:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利被"它"捉住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It got Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:42.35,1:39:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,喂?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:46.39,1:39:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.35,1:39:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我会去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll meet you there.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.39,1:39:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,你这是要去哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And just where do you think you're off to?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:59.23,1:40:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,去见朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out with my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.23,1:40:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,宝贝 你不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweetie, you can't go.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.79,1:40:05.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你病还没好 知道吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're getting over your sickness, remember?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.23,1:40:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我的病?\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sickness?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:07.87,1:40:09.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 我生什么病了 妈妈?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, what sickness, Ma?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:12.19,1:40:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道这些是什么药吗? 是安慰剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what these are? They're gazebos!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.83,1:40:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,都是骗人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:22.43,1:40:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,这药对你有好处 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}They help you, Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.31,1:40:26.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我这是在保护你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.15,1:40:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,保护我?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protect me?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.67,1:40:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,对我说谎还把我关在这个地狱里?\N{\fnArial\fs30}By lying to me? By keeping me locked inside this hellhole?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:31.83,1:40:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry but the only people that were...
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.39,1:40:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,但是只有我的朋友真的想保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}actually trying to protect me were my friends.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:35.91,1:40:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在我真正需要他们的时候 你却让我背叛了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you made me turn my back on them when I really needed them.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:38.27,1:40:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我现在要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:39.43,1:40:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie. Eddie. No.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:42.43,1:40:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你马上给我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get back here.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.71,1:40:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我要见我的朋友 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry, Mom, I gotta go save my friends. - Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.71,1:40:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,别这样对我 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this to me, Eddie!
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.99,1:41:14.13,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 上尖刺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, spikes.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:03.63,1:42:04.63,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦利?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:07.19,1:42:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦利 我们一定要去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, we all have to go.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.19,1:42:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly was right.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:12.27,1:42:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我们像上次那样分开 小丑会把我们各个击破\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we split up like last time, that clown will kill us one by one.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:17.03,1:42:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,但只要我们团结在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if we stick together,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:21.39,1:42:22.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我们一起…\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of us,
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.43,1:42:25.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就能赢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll win.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:26.63,1:42:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise.
Dialogue: 0,1:42:54.43,1:42:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,埃迪 你有硬币吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eddie, you got a quarter?
Dialogue: 0,1:42:58.63,1:43:00.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要在这鬼玩意里许愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't want to make a wish in that fucking thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:05.87,1:43:07.54,Default,,0,0,0,,贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beverly?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:07.75,1:43:09.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要怎么下去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are we supposed to get down there?
Dialogue: 0,1:43:11.03,1:43:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,行了 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:43:29.51,1:43:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,好了 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.15,1:45:13.10,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, guys. Help.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.35,1:45:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 伙计 - 是 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, buddy? - Yeah, I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.47,1:45:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,上来 贝弗利 上来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Step right up, Beverly. Step right up.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:25.67,1:45:29.45,Default,,0,0,0,,来换装 来漂浮 你会笑 你会哭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come change. Come float. You'll laugh. You'll cry.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:29.67,1:45:33.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你会欢呼 你会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll cheer. You'll die.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:34.03,1:45:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,为大家介绍 会跳舞者小丑:潘尼怀斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Introducing Pennywise the Dancing Clown.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:13.19,1:46:14.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:21.75,1:46:23.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我会让你怕的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:46:36.07,1:46:38.50,Default,,0,0,0,,救命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! Help me!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.35,1:46:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ahhh!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:51.07,1:46:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Die!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:54.23,1:46:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:55.47,1:46:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike! - Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:57.59,1:46:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你没事吧 麦克?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay? Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:46:59.83,1:47:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,鲍尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bowers.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:01.31,1:47:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克 靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike. Fuck.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:04.03,1:47:05.34,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 他在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike! - Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:06.79,1:47:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他要对我们下手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're next.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:08.35,1:47:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:09.87,1:47:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抓住 - 抓住绳子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Grab it! - Get the rope! Get the rope!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:11.79,1:47:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,哦 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:14.31,1:47:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike! - Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:16.55,1:47:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,别碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave him alone!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:19.67,1:47:21.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你不听我的话是不是?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't listen to what I told you, did you?
Dialogue: 0,1:47:23.23,1:47:25.82,Default,,0,0,0,,你该离开德里镇的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should've stayed out of Derry.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:26.07,1:47:28.86,Default,,0,0,0,,你父母没走 结果呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your parents didn't and look what happened to them.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:29.99,1:47:32.55,Default,,0,0,0,,每次路过那些骨灰 我都好伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I still get sad every time I pass by that pile of ashes.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:33.03,1:47:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,好伤心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sad,
Dialogue: 0,1:47:35.27,1:47:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,如果是我放的火就好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I couldn't have done it myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:37.55,1:47:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快跑 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run, Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:45.71,1:47:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.19,1:47:49.25,Default,,0,0,0,,别想起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuck down!
Dialogue: 0,1:47:52.31,1:47:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我要 要 要上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should get up there.
Dialogue: 0,1:47:54.71,1:47:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗? 你怎么上得去?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you insane? With what?
Dialogue: 0,1:48:25.19,1:48:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit.
