Dialogue: 0,1:58:49.99,1:58:53.61,Default,,0,0,0,,直到老死再回到地下\N{\fnArial\fs30}until old age takes you back to the weeds.
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.47,1:58:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,走吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave...
