Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.95,1:59:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.79,1:59:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你揍我脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You punched me in the face.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.79,1:59:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我趟灰水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made me walk through shitty water.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.55,1:59:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你还把我带进这个该死的恐怖巢穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You brought me to a fucking crackhead house.
