Dialogue: 0,1:59:45.67,1:59:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我他妈还得杀了这小丑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna have to kill this fucking clown.
Dialogue: 0,1:59:48.11,1:59:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,欢迎加入废柴俱乐部 你个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to the Losers' Club, asshole!
Dialogue: 0,1:59:57.43,1:59:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,- 麦克 - 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mike! - Mike!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.75,2:00:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,斯坦利 当心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stan, watch out!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:08.63,2:00:09.69,Default,,0,0,0,,麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mike!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:19.19,2:00:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,快杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kill him!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:48.67,2:00:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill you!
Dialogue: 0,2:00:56.07,2:00:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,嗨 贝弗利 你还是我的小宝贝吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bevvie. Are you still my little...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:08.55,2:01:09.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,2:01:29.43,2:01:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,原来你杀不了贝弗利\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you didn't kill Beverly.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:32.87,2:01:36.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是因 因 因为她不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause she wasn't afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:36.87,2:01:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们也不怕你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we aren't either.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:39.43,2:01:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,不再怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:43.23,2:01:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,现在害怕的人是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're the one who's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:47.07,2:01:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你会饿死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're gonna starve.
Dialogue: 0,2:01:55.71,2:01:58.27,Default,,0,0,0,,只见他猛挥拳头往柱子上砸…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He thrusts his fists against the posts...
Dialogue: 0,2:01:58.43,2:02:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,直说自己把鬼碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and still insists he sees the ghosts...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:02.19,2:02:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只见他猛挥拳头往柱子上砸\N{\fnArial\fs30}"He thrusts his fists against the posts"
Dialogue: 0,2:02:24.75,2:02:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,恐惧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear...
Dialogue: 0,2:02:37.75,2:02:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道我暑假社会实践论文该写什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what I'm doing for my summer experience essay.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:53.39,2:02:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys. Guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:02:56.99,2:02:59.14,Default,,0,0,0,,那些孩子都飘下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The kids are floating down.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:17.87,2:04:20.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我只能想起来一部分 不过…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can only remember parts,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:21.43,2:04:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为我已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought I was dead.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:24.59,2:04:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时就感觉自己已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it felt like.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:27.59,2:04:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到我们一起回到那个下水道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw us, all of us together back in the cistern,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:30.95,2:04:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,不过我们都长大了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we were older,
Dialogue: 0,2:04:33.47,2:04:35.54,Default,,0,0,0,,就像我们父母那么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}like, our parents' ages.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:36.59,2:04:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在那做 做 做什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were we all doing there?
Dialogue: 0,2:04:40.47,2:04:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我只记得那时候的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just remember how we felt.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:44.19,2:04:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,只记得我们很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}How scared we were.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:45.99,2:04:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我应该永远也忘不掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can ever forget that.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:53.75,2:04:54.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我们立个誓吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear it.
Dialogue: 0,2:04:55.83,2:04:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swear...
Dialogue: 0,2:04:57.63,2:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,如果"它"没有死\N{\fnArial\fs30}if It isn't dead,
Dialogue: 0,2:05:00.31,2:05:03.74,Default,,0,0,0,,如果"它"又回来了 我们也会回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}if It ever comes back, we'll come back, too.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:28.63,2:06:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我要走了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:32.51,2:06:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我恨你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:43.87,2:06:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:45.95,2:06:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 斯坦利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Stan.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:52.59,2:06:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了 伙伴们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, guys.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:53.83,2:06:54.83,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 麦克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Mike.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:55.03,2:06:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you later, losers.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:58.03,2:06:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around, Bill.
Dialogue: 0,2:06:59.19,2:07:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 瑞奇\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, Rich.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:00.39,2:07:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,再见了伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you guys later.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:03.15,2:07:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,再见 本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye, Ben.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:09.23,2:07:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你要搬去波特兰吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all packed for Portland?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:13.07,2:07:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,嗯 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:15.67,2:07:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我明早出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going tomorrow morning.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:17.07,2:07:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你会去多久?\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long will you be gone?
Dialogue: 0,2:07:20.75,2:07:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我姨妈说我想在那住多久都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}My aunt, she says I can stay for as long as I want, so...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:27.83,2:07:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我想告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just so you know...
Dialogue: 0,2:07:31.39,2:07:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,和你们在一起的时候我 一点都不觉得自己是废柴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never felt like a loser when I was with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,2:07:43.95,2:07:45.38,Default,,0,0,0,,回头见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you around.
Dialogue: 0,2:08:33.07,2:08:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bye.
